WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.500 line:68%
October 7 is important for what it was,

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:08.700 line:68%
an important operation of the Palestinian
resistance.

00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:15.000
It is important because on that day tens
of thousands of people

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:22.300
imprisoned for decades in a concentration
camp, in an open-air prison,

00:00:22.300 --> 00:00:26.000
tore down walls, tore down fences.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:32.000
In all acts of resistance, in all acts of
war carried out by human beings,

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:39.000
there may have been some marginal episodes
that were wrong,

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:45.000
but we can compare October 7 to one of the
most important partisan actions,

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:51.800
for example of the Italian Resistance,
like the one in Via Rasella,

00:00:51.800 --> 00:00:56.500
in which, as we know, there were civilian
deaths, even a child.

00:00:56.500 --> 00:01:02.000
But this, even our regret over it, if you
like,

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:06.500
cannot change the perspective from which
we analyse that event.

00:01:06.500 --> 00:01:09.500
That is an act of resistance.
